Data files under release_data/:
- CC BY 4.0 applies ONLY to content produced by this project: the gold
  annotations (annotator labels, adjudication verdicts, final gold labels),
  stratum assignments and weights, audit measurements (duplicate, leakage,
  near-duplicate and clean-test decisions), model predictions and aggregate
  results.
- Third-party benchmark content is NOT covered by this licence and is NOT
  redistributed: raw texts, original benchmark labels, source/provenance
  fields, and the Northcutt et al. (2021) MTurk votes. Row indices and SHA-1
  digests only point to rows in the user's own copy of each dataset; original
  labels are rebuilt locally by tools/prepare_from_release.py.
- Each benchmark remains under the terms of its original publisher.
